{"name":"Braids by Peace Joy — Luxury Braiding Studio","short_name":"Braids by Peace Joy","description":"Braids by Peace Joy is a luxury braiding studio in Randallstown, Maryland (PHENIX Salon Suites, Suite 101) offering knotless braids, boho braids, box braids, cornrows, stitch braids, Fulani braids and twists for adults and kids. Open 7 days, 8 AM – 7 PM, with online booking.","start_url":"/","display":"browser","background_color":"#0b1a4a","theme_color":"#0b1a4a","icons":[{"src":"/icon.png","sizes":"512x512","type":"image/png","purpose":"any"}]}